extends RefCounted
## What the fog isles' people say and are called (FogTheme.life, read through LifePools.of): a cursed fishing
## village on a grey shore, keeping its lanterns lit against the fog and what walks in it - the drowned who come
## up out of the bay, the ghosts in the dead wood, the wreck nobody sails near.
## Tokens in {braces} are filled by IslandLife (LifePools.fill).

