			"Salt by the sack. Don't haggle, it's for your own good.", "Wool from the mainland. Warm. Dry. Rare, here."],
		"market": ["Salt! Fine salt! Salt for the door!", "Oil's dear since the long fog. Buy now, before it's dearer.", "Haggle if you like. I've nowhere to be after dark either.",
