		"home": ["Door lamp's lit. Shutters are mended. Salt's down.", "The children are inside. I counted them twice.", "Roof leaks. Everything leaks. The fog leaks in through the walls.",
			"Knitting another shawl. Grey wool. All the wool's grey here.", "Somebody keeps leaving wet footprints on my step. I keep sweeping them.",
			"My husband's chair. Nobody sits in it. Not even me.", "Bread's rising. It rises slow in the damp."],
		"plaza": ["Stand under the big lantern. Safest spot in the village.", "Elder's been looking at the bay all morning. Never a good sign.", "The square's lantern has never gone out. Never once.",
			"Old men by the lamp, arguing about the tide. Every day.", "Somebody carved a name in the lamp post. Somebody who didn't come back.",
			"Children play lantern-tag here. Last one out of the light's it.", "The fog stops at the square's edge. Like it's afraid of the lamp."],
		"inn": ["Pull up a stool by the fire. The warmest seat in the village.", "This round's on the man who saw the wreck and lived.", "To the lamps! May they never go out!",
