		"shrine": ["Ring the small bell when you come in. Let them know you're living.", "Lit a candle for the drowned. Light one for yourself, while you can.",
			"Quiet in the chapel. The fog doesn't come in. It waits on the step.", "Every name on that wall went down in the bay.",
			"The bell rope's frayed. Don't tell the bell-ringer I said so.", "Pray if you want. The bell does most of the work.",
