		"well": ["Water's cold. Tastes of iron and something older.", "Lid on the well, always. Things climb.", "Bucket came up with seaweed in it. Seaweed. In a well.",
			"Drop a coin and wish for clear weather. Hasn't worked yet.", "Cold spot round the well. Always has been.", "Heave. Heave. Who dug this so deep?",
			"Gossip's free at the well. Ghosts too, some say."],
		"bench": ["Sit. Watch the fog. It's the only show we've got.", "Did you hear? The cooper's lad says he saw his own grandfather on the strand.",
