		"pointer": ["If you're after work, {who} {where} has been white as a sheet for days.", "{who}'s got trouble. Fog-trouble, the worst kind.",
			"Go and see {who} {where}. Nobody else will help, and the nights are getting longer.", "{who} {where} looked haunted this morning. Worth a word.",
