	"rumour_isle": {
		"camp": ["{name}'s gang camp in the dead wood. Pirates aren't afraid of ghosts, they say. They will be.",
			"They say {name} came here for the wreck's gold. Hasn't found it. Has found other things."],
		"beast": ["{name} walks the fog. You hear it first. You always hear it first.",
			"Nobody goes past the dead oaks any more. {name} has been seen there, and the ones who went to look came back wrong."],
