	"rumour_chain": [
		"Ships that reach {name} come back with stories. {blurb}, they say. No fog there. Imagine that.",
		"A trader swore {name} has sun every day. Every day! I don't believe it.",
		"The needle pulls toward {name} next. {blurb}. Anywhere but here sounds lovely.",
		"I've a cousin on {name}. Writes every spring. Says the dead stay dead there. Lucky them.",
	],
	"rumour_quiet": ["Quiet island, this. The fog drinks sound. That's how you know it's listening.",
		"Rumours? Only that oil's dear this year. True, too.",
		"Nothing worth your ears. The fog keeps its secrets.",
		"Can't say I've heard a thing. Ask the bell-ringer. Bells hear everything.",
		"Quiet season. Even the drowned seem to be sleeping.",
		"Not a whisper. That's either good news or very bad news.",
		"Heard nothing, Captain. The bell drowns out the gossip.",
		"No news here. The last news was a fog that lasted a year.",
		"Nothing new. Same fog, same lamps, same old ghosts."],
	"rumour_fork": "The sea splits past here: {a}, or {b}. Toss a coin. Anything's better than fog.",
	"rumour_end": "Past us? The edge of the world, the old ones say, where the drowned go when the sea's done with them.",
	"rumour_hard": "Harder country than this, mind. And here's hard enough.",
	"self_menu": "Tell me about yourself.",
	"accept": "I'll see to it.",
	"decline": "Not now.",
	"taken": ["Good. I'll be here. Inside the light.",
		"Truly? Bless you, Captain. Take a lantern.",
		"That's a weight off. I'll leave a lamp in the window for you.",
		"Ha! I knew a pirate would do it. Nobody here would.",
		"Thank you. Watch the fog; it plays tricks.",
		"You're a good sort, for a pirate. Off you go, then. Keep to the lamps.",
		"Grand. I'll tell the others. No, I won't. I'll surprise them.",
		"Done, then. Mind the drowned, and the dead trees, and the drowned again.",
		"Come back breathing. The last helper didn't. Well, he came back.",
		"Right. I'll be waiting, chewing my nails to the knuckle.",
		"Shake on it. There. Warm hands. That's good. Here, that's good."],
	"notices": {
		"board": ["A notice board under a lamp, pinned thick with damp paper.",
			"The board by the chapel, its notices curling and grey with the fog.",
			"Nails, twine and notices, wet through. Some are fresh.",
			"A driftwood board, carved with names of the lost and covered in warnings.",
			"Wet paper notices flutter on the board. One has a handprint on it, in salt.",
			"A leaning board by the well, half its notices faded by the mist."],
		"bounty": ["WANTED: {name}. Robbing graves and stealing oil. Report the deed to {poster}.",
			"BOUNTY on {name}, camped in the dead wood with a gang of cutthroats. A purse waits with {poster}.",
			"{name} broke the strand lamps and robbed the salt store. Bring word of their end to {poster}.",
