			"By order of the whole village: {name} must go. Every coin we could spare is with {poster}."],
		"lair": ["Help wanted: clear out {name}. Things come out of it at night and take the lamp oil. Paid by {poster}.",
			"{name} has to go. Brave souls only. Report to {poster} when it's quiet.",
