	"service": {
		"inn": ["Beds upstairs, fire down here, rum by the jug.",
			"Room's dry. Driest in the village. Lamp in every window.",
			"Boots off by the fire. Leave the fog at the door.",
			"Stay the night. Nobody walks the strand after dark.",
			"Rest up, Captain. The fog will still be there tomorrow. It always is.",
			"Straw mattress, wool blanket, a lamp that never goes out."],
		"trade": ["Oil, rope, salt, tar. Everything a ship needs to get away from here.",
			"Pirate loot? I'll buy it. No questions, low prices.",
